                            dip_floor=algedonic signature. ◐ partially consumed."
  EXP-AB-01 basin_floor:   "basin_floor=0.875, resilience_margin=0.175. CODE: ◯ NOT CONSUMED anywhere.
                            OPPORTUNITY: parameterize the algedonic/omega proximity margin from 0.175,
                            and use 0.875 as the vr/lyapunov 'expected floor' sanity bound."
