                            EXP-PSI-MESH (joint basin overlap baseline)."
  EXP-SR-01 s3_resilience: "A_auto (viable w/ S3 frozen). CODE: ◯ paper-only §8."
  EXP-TS/TSM thermal:      "viable@63°C; 240min zero drift. CODE: thermal_pressure→cgroup budget. ✓."
  EXP-OE-01 maxwell:       "observer constitutivity, ΔH=0.12 bits. CODE: ◯ paper-only §10."
  EXP-NC-*  controls:      "dip_floor=0.942 EXCLUSIVE VSF signature. CODE: validates algedonic gate. ✓."
  EXP-PHI-01/-bis:         "VSL sovereignty/fidelity. CODE: informed coupling.rs + VSI. → Paper 2."
  EXP-TDA-01 (H1/H2):      "β₀=1 plateau + D_eff≈3. CODE: vr_complex ε=0.30, floor 0.05, maxdim=1. ✓."

  incorporation_gaps:   // DONE results with implementation value NOT yet wired
    "1. basin_floor 0.875 / margin 0.175 (EXP-AB-01) → algedonic proximity threshold + sanity bound.
     2. dip_floor 0.942 (EXP-TC-01/NC) → formalize as the canonical algedonic-dip constant.
     3. θ_PSI 0.79 duplicated (reframe.rs + s4.rs) → single source.
     ⇒ these motivate the CALIBRATION REGISTRY (Part 4)."

